---
/**
 * One quiet line under the hero: what Anderson is playing on Spotify, or
 * played last. Filled in by scripts/site.ts from /api/spotify/now-playing;
 * stays hidden if Spotify has nothing or fails. The cover sits on a little
 * record that spins while a song is playing and rests when it isn't.
 */
---

<p class="np" data-now-playing data-state="loading" hidden>
  <span aria-hidden="true" class="vinyl">
    <span class="disc"><img alt="" class="art" decoding="async" height="16" loading="lazy" width="16" /></span>
    <i class="arm"></i>
  </span>
  <span>
    <span data-np-label>Last played</span>:{" "}
    <a data-np-link href="https://open.spotify.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><b data-np-track></b></a>
    {" "}by <span data-np-artist></span>
  </span>
</p>
